{{ModBox}}
{{M|Aerial Bond}} is a [[Companion]] [[mod]] that reduces the companion recovery timer on [[airborne]] kills. The companion will also generate a {{D|Cold}} field when the owner is airborne, which remains for 3 seconds upon landing.

