==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[The Business]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Doer''' with {{Faction|Solaris United}}.

==Notes==
* Recovery Timer Reduction from airborne kills only applies when making kills with weapons, not abilities.
* The AoE {{D|Cold}} field can reach up to 10 {{D|Cold}} stacks and freeze enemies.

